    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the heart of darkness with FERB, a gripping horror game that drops you deep into the shadows of a mysterious cave packed with secrets and bone-chilling horrors. You\u2019re a seasoned explorer on a mission to find out what happened to a missing adventurer\u2014but you\u2019ll quickly realize you\u2019re not alone down here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hiding in the dark is FERB, a terrifying, half-robotic creature that thrives on fear. Its glowing gaze is always watching, and every step you take brings you closer to uncovering the cave\u2019s secrets\u2026 but also closer to it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With five intense chapters to explore, you\u2019ll solve puzzles, gather clues, and unravel the mystery of what happened to those who came before you. Each discovery paints a darker, more unsettling picture, and survival will test your courage, wits, and nerves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can go it alone, armed only with your instincts, or team up with friends in a nerve-wracking co-op mode\u2014where every move, every sound, and every wrong turn could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be warned: FERB isn\u2019t just lurking in the shadows\u2014it\u2019s hunting you. Can you outsmart it, survive the horrors, and uncover the truth about the cave? There\u2019s only one way to find out.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the heart of darkness with FERB, a gripping horror game that drops you deep into the shadows of a mysterious cave packed with secrets and bone-chilling horrors. You\u2019re a seasoned explorer on a mission to find out what happened to a missing adventurer\u2014but you\u2019ll quickly realize you\u2019re not alone down here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hiding in the dark is FERB, a terrifying, half-robotic creature that thrives on fear. Its glowing gaze is always watching, and every step you take brings you closer to uncovering the cave\u2019s secrets\u2026 but also closer to it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With five intense chapters to explore, you\u2019ll solve puzzles, gather clues, and unravel the mystery of what happened to those who came before you. Each discovery paints a darker, more unsettling picture, and survival will test your courage, wits, and nerves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can go it alone, armed only with your instincts, or team up with friends in a nerve-wracking co-op mode\u2014where every move, every sound, and every wrong turn could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be warned: FERB isn\u2019t just lurking in the shadows\u2014it\u2019s hunting you. Can you outsmart it, survive the horrors, and uncover the truth about the cave? There\u2019s only one way to find out.</p>",
    "short_description": "Descend into darkness in FERB, a horror adventure where you explore a foreboding cave, uncover secrets, and face a half-robotic beast that thrives on fear. Solve puzzles, survive five intense chapters, and outsmart FERB in solo or co-op play. Will you uncover the truth\u2014or be hunted?",
